                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e99b2394-6836-39ff-bad4-66ee6d3850cc",
                        "entry_id": "20dcded0-f7dd-3183-99a5-7f878160f59d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "lie, falsehood"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "plural",
                            "plural-only"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "475b85d2-af2d-475f-b997-75008897242f",
                                "sense_id": "e99b2394-6836-39ff-bad4-66ee6d3850cc",
                                "text": "Вра́ки. Я не ве́рю, чтоб во́лосы бы́ли у всех счи́таны.[...]",
                                "translation": "Denis Fonvizin",
                                "english": "Denis Fonvizin"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3dbe8bf3-f79c-4706-bbdc-aea1da9c92dd",
                                "sense_id": "e99b2394-6836-39ff-bad4-66ee6d3850cc",
                                "text": "— А, ви́дишь, что и не́ было совсе́м англича́нина, ста́ло быть, вра́ки. И Варва́ра Петро́вна и Степа́н Трофи́мович о́ба врут. Да и все врут.",
                                "translation": "\"Ah, you see, there wasn't any Englishman, so it's all a pack of lies. Varvara Petrovna and Stepan Trofimovich are both lying. And everyone else is lying, too.\"",
                                "english": "\"Ah, you see, there wasn't any Englishman, so it's all a pack of lies. Varvara Petrovna and Stepan Trofimovich are both lying. And everyone else is lying, too.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
